# NAS-Speicher (JD13, eigene Grafik im JFNetworker-Stil)
master: Network attached storage
name.de: NAS-Speicher
name.en: NAS storage
name.es: Almacenamiento NAS
name.it: Storage NAS
name.fr: Stockage NAS
prompt.de: NAS-Speicher: eigenständiger Dateispeicher im Netz.
prompt.en: NAS storage: standalone network file storage.
prompt.es: Almacenamiento NAS: almacenamiento de archivos independiente en red.
prompt.it: Storage NAS: archiviazione file autonoma in rete.
prompt.fr: Stockage NAS : stockage de fichiers autonome en réseau.
keywords.de: NAS-Speicher, Rack, 19 Zoll, HE
keywords.en: NAS storage, rack, 19 inch, U
keywords.es: Almacenamiento NAS, rack, 19 pulgadas, U
keywords.it: Storage NAS, rack, 19 pollici, U
keywords.fr: Stockage NAS, baie, 19 pouces, U
svg: ../../symbols/rack/nas_2u.svg
scale: 1:20
size: 482.6 mm x 88.9 mm
size.us: 19 in x 3.5 in
